{"book":"jonah","num":4,"verses":[{"en":"But it displeased Jonah exceedingly, and he was very angry.","n":1,"sm":"Ua matua leaga lava lenei mea ia lona, ua ita lava o ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"matua"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"lona,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ita"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"And he prayed unto the LORD, and said, I pray thee, O LORD, was not this my saying, when I was yet in my country? Therefore I fled before unto Tarshish: for I knew that thou art a gracious God, and merciful, slow to anger, and of great kindness, and repentest thee of the evil.","n":2,"sm":"Ona tatalo ai lea o ia i le ALII, ua faapea atu, O lenei, le Aw e, e le o laʻu upu ea lenei ina o ou i aii loʻu nuu? O le mea foi lea na ou muai sola ai i Tasesa; aua ua ou iloa oe o le Atua alofa fua, ma le alofa mutimutivale, e tele gese lou toasa, ua tele foi lou alofa, ua e salamo foi ma ua le faaoo le malaia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tatalo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"atu,"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei,"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Aw"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"aii"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu?"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"muai"},{"en":"","sm":"sola"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Tasesa;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":""